    "legality_health_side_fails_by": "BHL Eq.(14) has NO derivative term: 4pi p_r(r0) = -F(r0)/2 exactly, while a canonical scalar supplies 4pi p_{r,phi}(r0) = 4pi(K0 + V0) >= 0. F(r0) > 0 (healthy tensor) demands p_r < 0: impossible for every grid row, any throat data. Marginal F=0 gives K0=V0=0 only (zero kinetic coefficient, not healthy)."
  }
